    "lint_pass": true,
    "what_en": "Claude becomes a web-novel coach: confirms topic, builds world/characters, produces book/volume/chapter outlines. Stops there by default; writes prose only on explicit request. Each chapter outline is a separate file.",
    "when_en": "Triggered by phrases like '帮我开书', '写大纲', or the command /story-long-write. A bare call only diagnoses the project and lists next steps without writing.",
    "say_en": [
      {
        "text": "Help me start a book and give me the outline plus the first 10 chapter outlines.",
